    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0663" n="647" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg647"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/7–2847: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-07-28T19:00:00-05:00">July 28, 1947—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>411. President Grau late this afternoon informed me that energetic measures are
                    being taken to suffocate revolutionary activity based on <pb facs="0664" n="648"
                        xml:id="pg648"/> Cuban soil and directed against Dominican Republic which
                    has been subject recent telegrams. He further declared public statement this
                    effect will be issued and subsequent ones as situation warrants.</p>
                <p>Inform War and Navy.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 411, repeated Ciudad Trujillo and Port-au-Prince.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
